00498251269016", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1800498254602349_7690139037800046070_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LFM7mVQifcAQ7kNvwH1iAzu&_nc_oc=Adq9oquzUIBgIncaikjHp3iG7co8Dq7Ji7vAhGz81_7UR79Hwzdv_vQ2B11HcNVJs6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTySvHl3MZShjv2M6rbXmNvfHcqka-fSvsk0ODXEMj2zA&oe=6AFC8AA3"}, {"file_name": "06-underwater-suite.png", "id": "1748596556212596", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1748596559545929_7771862217858478968_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sQ5f1PMiY6MQ7kNvwFaQZfE&_nc_oc=AdqXKFyIyJUEolkbKT0rkbeta594XNTJVddNfmfRnAUiIsH6yVANqnCkq8jhG_EtGQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT1q8AqjDShOfoV77sIsXkjXLd6TCaK_d2GfEd0hKwPCg&oe=6AFC6A4D"}, {"file_name": "03-library.png", "id": "1667160411544135", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1667160414877468_7254240046087516255_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mFQoQarnoPYQ7kNvwFKgpzs&_nc_oc=AdqTaUOzrLrGFWlYbtNWefEGq1yiySQSST2eypaaFT2Y0T1gfvLZeZtCdyJyc2fL5_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTgHoOl754-R4BEH7Fw4UXJgzhKguztJDjzPiFxHB17lg&oe=6AFC7425"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_image_2560x1440.png", "id": "28714564714881699", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_28714564721548365_6711605436381968107_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QjqmNBInxzMQ7kNvwFzuB5c&_nc_oc=AdqIqn1hWsrNTrDYdWrP5XGmqL9kXq8BeFDw5B9PIDZAFwxZ23qEdkWBWWTNho9zEqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBexIwiFaTKGmJeQR5LkI6RFVdc4r0ur3FnxLaCjMndw&oe=6AFC7225"}, "display_name": "Amona Player for Plex", "keywords": ["cinema", "movies", "amona", "plex", "player"], "long_description": "Amona Player turns your Meta Quest 3, 3S, 2 or Pro into a private movie theater for your own Plex library. Link your Plex account with a code, pick a room, and play your movies and shows on a giant screen. \n\n\u2022 Immersive rooms: an Art Deco cinema, a home cinema, a night train, an underwater suite, or your own room in passthrough. \n\u2022 3D with real depth: side-by-side 3D movies are detected and shown in depth. \n\u2022 The original sound: DTS and TrueHD decoded right on the headset. \n\u2022 Offline: download movies to watch without a connection (Plex Pass and the server owner's permission required). \n\u2022 Your settings remembered: audio and subtitle tracks, plus a button to skip intros and credits. \n\u2022 All your servers, one tap to switch between them. \u2022 Lighting to your taste: dim the room, or your real room in passthrough. \n\u2022 English and French interface. Requires a Plex account and a Plex Media Server with your own media, with secure connections enabled (the Plex default). \n\n\nAmona Player is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by Plex, Inc. Films in the screenshots are open movies under Creative Commons licences: Charge, Sprite Fright ((CC) Blender Foundation | studio.blender.org, CC BY 4.0); Sintel (\u00a9 Blender Foundation | www.sintel.org, CC BY 3.0); Big Buck Bunny ((c) 2008 Blender Foundation / www.bigbuckbunny.org, CC BY 3.0); Sol Levante, Meridian (Netflix, opencontent.netflix.com, CC BY 4.0).", "short_description": "Watch your Plex movies and shows in a virtual cinema. Amona Player turns your Meta Quest into a private theater: link your Plex account, pick a room and enjoy your own library on a giant screen, with the sound as it was mixed."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://twobytes.fr/en/projets/amona-player-for-plex/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TwoBytesFR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://twobytes.fr/"